description_snippet:
OUR MISSION
At Simply Wall St, we help people become confident, long-term investors. The stock market offers an exceptional opportunity for building wealth, but it’s easy to fail. While many chase quick wins, we believe in thinking long-term and investing like a business shareholder. Our product gives individual investors the capabilities to build a portfolio, previously only available to professionals.




WHY JOIN?
Help us empower individuals by giving them a new way to invest in stocks;


Work at a profitable, global, B2C SaaS startup;


Operating at scale with 6.5 million users across 180 countries;


Small team and flexible working environment;


Work with a product customers love: 4.5* Trustpilot Reviews;


Strong employee retention with 70% of the team with us for >2 years.




Role Context
Simply Wall St has undergone a significant evolution, moving from a research platform to a Portfolio Command Center. This shift represents a fundamental change in our product and brand, designed to give stock investors the ultimate control room for managing their wealth.


Affiliate partnerships are one of our highest-efficiency growth channels, and they are only as strong as the partners in them. As Affiliate Partnerships Manager, your mission is to find high-potential partners, sign them, and turn them into consistent, high-performing sources of subscribers. You are equal parts hunter and relationship-builder. You spend your day finding the right partners, opening conversations, getting on calls, and staying on top of follow-ups until deals are done and partners are producing.


This is a fully-remote role, engaged in the capacity as an independent contractor, based out of India, Thailand, Malaysia or Philippines.




What You'll Do
Prospect and acquire new high-potential partners (affiliates, comparison and review publishers, influencers, and content creators) that fit our ideal partner profile.


